  "body": "45paunui.co.nz\r\n\r\nOne already under contract - Don't miss out!\r\n\r\nWith its sparkling shoreline, leafy streets, and village charm, St Heliers stands as Auckland’s premier seaside community. Perfectly positioned on a sun-soaked, tree-lined street just moments from the village, 45 Paunui is an exclusive enclave of ten boutique homes — each individually designed for privacy and effortless modern living.\r\n\r\nCreated by CMP Living, specialists in architectural developments of distinction, these homes balance timeless design with everyday practicality. A refined exterior palette of clay brick, vertical cedar and Colorsteel creates a sophisticated, low-maintenance façade. Inside, elevated finishes flow seamlessly to landscaped alfresco areas, while state-of-the-art automation brings ease and security through gated entry, video access, and integrated climate control.\r\n\r\nConstruction has commenced, with completion expected in Q4 2027. Residence Eight — a stunning, standalone three-bedroom, 2.5-bath home — is now available off-plan. \r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n\r\n• Prime St Heliers location down a private, gated driveway\r\n• Marble benchtops and premium appliances\r\n• 2.7m ceiling height with double glazing\r\n• Oak flooring and Italian tiling\r\n• Wiser Smart Home technology\r\n• Stamford 10-Year Build Warranty\r\n• Integrated air conditioning\r\n• Award-winning builders\r\n• Architect consultation available for personalisation\r\n\r\nOffering 172m² of thoughtfully crafted living space across two levels, Residence Eight enjoys secure garaging and one of the largest sections in the development — 284m² — tucked away in the tranquil north-west corner. Expansive glazing floods interiors with light, while natural textures and understated tones create an atmosphere of warmth and sophistication.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen combines beauty and function with marble benchtops, bespoke timber cabinetry and premium appliances. The bathrooms evoke a spa-like serenity with Italian tiles and brushed nickel fittings. Outdoors, a sheltered tiled courtyard — complete with integrated fire — invites long summer evenings and intimate winter gatherings alike.\r\n\r\nThis is the future of refined living in St Heliers — appealing equally to families drawn by exceptional local schools, professionals seeking easy city access, and discerning downsizers who value walkable amenities and a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n8/45 Paunui Street is more than a home — it’s a statement of quality and a lifestyle investment in one of Auckland’s most desirable seaside communities.\r\n\r\nVisit the Show Suite\r\n45 Paunui Street, St Heliers\r\nOpen homes as advertised or by appointment.\r\n\r\nFor further information:\r\nCarl Watkins | 021 424 736 | c.watkins@barfoot.co.nz\r\n\r\nAmelia Dalzell | 021 305 545 | a.dalzell@barfoot.co.nz\r\n\r\nDisclaimer - Renders are artist impressions",
